  "description": "+Speedster – The Ultimate Touring Tandem for Epic Adventures\nThe Speedster Tandem is the benchmark for touring tandems, built to handle the most demanding, self-supported expeditions across any terrain. Known for its reliability, strength, and stability, this tandem has proven itself over the years on countless roads and continents. Whether you're planning an epic journey to South America or tackling challenging terrain in the Outback, the Speedster is the perfect companion for your next adventure of a lifetime.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 700c wheels with 32-35mm tires for a fast, stable ride on any surface\n\nExclusive Reynolds air-hardening 631 steel tubes for exceptional strength and lightweight performance\n\nOversized 44mm head tube & unicrown touring fork for enhanced stability and control\n\nProven Co-Motion touring geometry for a smooth, comfortable long-distance ride\n\nRack & fender mounts and dual disc brakes for reliable stopping power and convenient load carrying\n\nHand-built tandem touring wheels for strength and durability on any adventure\n\nDrivetrain options: Shimano 2x11, Rohloff, or Pinion P1.18 Gearbox for precise shifting and low maintenance\n\nChoose from road drop bars or mountain/trekking handlebars for optimal comfort and control on your tours\n\nWith the Speedster Tandem, you’re investing in the best. Designed for the most serious touring riders, the Speedster is ready to take on any adventure, big or small, with unparalleled performance and quality.\n\nComplete bike starting at $6,895.00\nConfigure custom features and price options below\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion Speedster order started!",
